{"turns":[{"text":"And disciplinary remains mercifully","zh":"而且纪律这东西，还算仁慈地保留着","start":5.39,"end":7.66},{"text":"Yes and um, I'm with you Derek, this star nonsense","zh":"对，嗯，德里克，我同意你，这明星什么的胡扯","start":7.81,"end":11.45},{"text":"Yes, yes","zh":"对，对","start":11.6,"end":12.47},{"text":"Now which is it?","zh":"那到底是哪个？","start":12.62,"end":13.74},{"text":"I am sure of it","zh":"我确定","start":13.89,"end":94.51},{"text":"So, so you think you can tell","zh":"那么，那么你觉得你能分辨吗","start":94.66,"end":101.37},{"text":"Heaven from hell?","zh":"天堂和地狱？","start":101.52,"end":105.08},{"text":"Blue skies from pain?","zh":"蓝天和痛苦？","start":105.23,"end":109.3},{"text":"Can you tell a green field","zh":"你能分辨一片绿野","start":109.45,"end":113.35},{"text":"From a cold steel rail?","zh":"和一根冰冷的钢轨吗？","start":113.5,"end":117.76},{"text":"A smile from a veil?","zh":"笑容和面纱吗？","start":117.91,"end":121.89},{"text":"Do you think you can tell?","zh":"你觉得你能分辨吗？","start":122.04,"end":126.05},{"text":"Did they get you to trade","zh":"他们有没有让你拿","start":126.2,"end":130.19},{"text":"Your heroes for ghosts?","zh":"你的英雄去换幽灵？","start":130.34,"end":134.17},{"text":"Hot ashes for trees?","zh":"拿热灰去换绿树？","start":134.32,"end":138.32},{"text":"Hot air for a cool breeze?","zh":"拿热风去换凉风？","start":138.47,"end":142.16},{"text":"Cold comfort for change?","zh":"拿冷冰冰的安慰去换改变？","start":142.31,"end":146.18},{"text":"Did you exchange","zh":"你有没有交换","start":146.33,"end":149.58},{"text":"A walk-on part in the war","zh":"在战争中跑个龙套","start":149.73,"end":153.09},{"text":"For a lead role in a cage?","zh":"去换在笼子里当主角？","start":153.24,"end":195.76},{"text":"How I wish, how I wish you were here","zh":"我多么希望，多么希望你在场","start":195.91,"end":202.19},{"text":"We're just two lost souls","zh":"我们只是两个迷失的灵魂","start":202.34,"end":204.93},{"text":"Swimming in a fish bowl","zh":"在鱼缸里游来游去","start":205.08,"end":207.65},{"text":"Year after year","zh":"年复一年","start":207.8,"end":211.83},{"text":"Running over the same old ground","zh":"跑过同样的老地方","start":211.98,"end":215.53},{"text":"What have we found?","zh":"我们找到了什么？","start":215.68,"end":217.9},{"text":"The same old fears","zh":"同样的旧恐惧","start":218.05,"end":221.69},{"text":"Wish you were here","zh":"希望你在场","start":221.84,"end":229.69}],"lessonTurns":[{"text":"And disciplinary remains mercifully","zh":"而且纪律这东西，还算仁慈地保留着","start":5.39,"end":7.66},{"text":"Yes and um, I'm with you Derek, this star nonsense","zh":"对，嗯，德里克，我同意你，这明星什么的胡扯","start":7.81,"end":11.45},{"text":"Yes, yes","zh":"对，对","start":11.6,"end":12.47},{"text":"Now which is it?","zh":"那到底是哪个？","start":12.62,"end":13.74},{"text":"I am sure of it","zh":"我确定","start":13.89,"end":94.51},{"text":"So, so you think you can tell","zh":"那么，那么你觉得你能分辨吗","start":94.66,"end":101.37}]}